# Sunday

- pnpm + Turborepo monorepo. Web app: `apps/web` (`@sunday/web`). Mobile: `apps/mobile` (Flutter). Desktop: `apps/desktop` (Tauri 2 / React).
- Shared analytics helpers: `@sunday/analytics` (PostHog + Sentry wrappers). Mobile uses Flutter SDKs; desktop uses `@sentry/react` + `posthog-js` with the same event names.
- Project / package name: **Sunday**. Public site name: **Nathan Zhao**. No employers, school, or private email on the site.
- Canonical URL: `https://sundaydev.vercel.app` (`site.url`).
- i18n: `next-intl`, English unprefixed (`/`), Chinese `/zh` (`localePrefix: as-needed`). Shared copy in `packages/content` (`@sunday/content`); mobile mirrors `apps/mobile/assets/messages/`.
- Contact form: Zod (`@sunday/contact`) + Sonner + Turnstile + rate limit; keep terminal UI (avoid stock shadcn form skins). Mobile and desktop post to the same `/api/contact`.
- Supabase: `supabase/schema/messages.sql` + RLS contract in `supabase/README.md` (anon INSERT-only).
- Quality gates: `pnpm check`, `pnpm test:e2e`, `pnpm test:lighthouse` (after build), `pnpm analyze`. Mobile: `flutter analyze`, `flutter test`, `.github/workflows/mobile.yml`. Desktop: `pnpm --filter @sunday/desktop typecheck|test`, `cargo clippy`, `.github/workflows/desktop.yml`; release CD: Actions → Desktop Cut Release → `.github/workflows/desktop-cut-release.yml` + `desktop-release.yml`.
- Format / lint (web + desktop TS): **Oxfmt** + **Oxlint** (`.oxfmtrc.json`, `.oxlintrc.json`). Not Prettier / ESLint. Mobile: `dart format` + `flutter_lints`. Desktop Rust: `cargo fmt` + `clippy`.
- Agent skills: `.agents/skills/` (source); `.cursor/skills/` symlinks for Cursor. Start with `seo-audit`.
- Before Next.js API changes, read `apps/web/node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
